@0x4007 @rndquu @koya0 `work.ubq.fi` is redirecting to `devpool.directory` on authentication. This happens because `https://devpool.directory/#` is the default URL. **This will be a blocker**. To fix it please check this: https://github.com/ubiquity/work.ubq.fi/pull/107#issuecomment-2396931530. You need to allow redirect to `https://work.ubq.fi/**` and `https://devpool.directory/**` in Supabase.
This is probably the latest supabase setting 
![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b93c018-cc9f-4d19-906d-80ed2ad90a98)

You should remove the `?ref` parameter from the URL after authentication. You can do that with:
```
const newURL = new URL(window.location.href);
newURL.searchParams.delete("ref");
window.history.pushState({}, "", newURL.toString());
```

